        "app_name": "TRIANGLE STRATEGY",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Immerse yourself in mixed reality (MR) using Meta Quest's Passthrough function and experience an epic tale where three nations fight for salt and iron in the land of Norzelia.\n\n# ■Multiple Endings\nPlayers will be forced to make difficult choices as they navigate the war-torn land of Norzelia.\nMaking value judgments and decisions based on the ideals of Utility, Morality, and Liberty will determine your Conviction. These parameters affect how the story branches and which companions join your party.\nWhere will your convictions lead you?\n\n# ■MR's Intuitive and Tactical Battles\nYour full field of view becomes the battlefield!\nSee the field from all 360 degrees, grab deployed units, and move them to a strategic location.\nTake on retro tactical battles with MR's intuitive controls.\n\n# ■Experience an Immersive HD-2D World with Meta Quest\nEach field can be enlarged, rotated, and freely moved around.\nTake in the beautiful, intricate diorama-like structures and townscapes from the characters' perspective and more in this deeply immersive experience.\n![{\"height\":622,\"type\":\"image\",\"width\":1920}](https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_3380504245583300_1617302469255751994_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AINDsME5TsEQ7kNvgHNr4M4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AYCWKiOYz4IyZf_bKyYQwCWzDDpxo-D6J9qFLC1f7cJJvg&oe=675569E0)",
